    "description": "## Summary\r\n\r\nThe `StoragePathViewSet.test()` endpoint at `POST /api/storage_paths/test/` has two compounding issues that allow any authenticated user (regardless of role or permissions) to read the content of other documents in the system, as well as extract user information.\r\n\r\n## Vulnerability Details\r\n\r\n### 1. Missing Object-Level Permission Check (IDOR)\r\n### 2. Insufficient Jinja2 Sandbox Allows Data Exfiltration",
